g results in multiple transcript variants. [provided by RefSeq, Jul 2012].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q96KP1","text":"Component of the exocyst complex involved in the docking of exocytic vesicles with fusion sites on the plasma membrane."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}